import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 751 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter · Overview — Matter Creation Through Law-Weaving","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 751 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter · Overview — Matter Creation Through Law-Weaving","no":751,"module":4,"tags":["Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter","Overview","Law-Weaving","Matter Creation","Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm"],"related":["15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law","13-Spatial-Law Dispatch System Details","80-Plane Theory and Classification"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0751_模块4-超多元级物质总论.md","filePath":"en/0751_模块4-超多元级物质总论.md"}'),r={name:"en/0751_模块4-超多元级物质总论.md"};function o(s,e,l,u,h,d){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-751-hyper-multiverse-grade-matter-·-overview-—-matter-creation-through-law-weaving" tabindex="-1">Entry 751 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter · Overview — Matter Creation Through Law-Weaving <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-751-hyper-multiverse-grade-matter-·-overview-—-matter-creation-through-law-weaving" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 751 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter · Overview — Matter Creation Through Law-Weaving&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 15, 13, 80</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-matter-is-not-dug-out-but-woven" tabindex="-1">Introduction: matter is not &quot;dug out,&quot; but &quot;woven&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-matter-is-not-dug-out-but-woven" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: matter is not &quot;dug out,&quot; but &quot;woven&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s understanding of matter stopped at &quot;extraction&quot; — mining ore, digging spirit stones, digging heaven-treasures. Matter already exists; all you do is find it, dig it out, use it. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s hyper-multiverse-grade matter view fundamentally overturns this premise: <strong>matter is not mined stock, but increment woven out by laws.</strong> When cultivators enter the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, what they master is no longer &quot;what to dig,&quot; but &quot;what to weave&quot; — using laws as thread, weaving entirely new matter to serve Myriad-Rank civilization.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are matter-creation&#39;s coordinate system: the anti-predation axiom requires matter creation go the increment-development route, not stock plunder; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires new matter be distributed fairly to Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires matter output serve the collective; the causal self-discipline axiom requires new-matter introduction go through reporting; the law-first axiom requires matter&#39;s law definition be self-consistent.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-upgrade-from-extraction-to-weaving" tabindex="-1">I. Why Upgrade from &quot;Extraction&quot; to &quot;Weaving&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-upgrade-from-extraction-to-weaving" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Upgrade from &quot;Extraction&quot; to &quot;Weaving&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old system&#39;s extraction mode has three fatal problems:</p><ol><li><strong>Stock is finite</strong>: any plane&#39;s natural veins, spirit mines, and heaven-treasures are finite; dig a little, lose a little;</li><li><strong>Extraction necessarily destroys</strong>: mining necessarily damages earth veins and ecology; short-term ore, long-term harm to the plane;</li><li><strong>Distribution is uneven</strong>: whoever holds the vein owns the resource; inevitably leading to predation and war.</li></ol><p>The law-weaving mode directly targets these three:</p><ul><li><strong>Increment is infinite</strong>: as long as the law network keeps running, new matter may be woven endlessly;</li><li><strong>No destruction</strong>: weaving completes at the law layer, not damaging physical ecology;</li><li><strong>Fair distribution</strong>: new matter is distributed through the Myriad-Rank sharing mechanism, not whoever grabs it owns it.</li></ul><h2 id="ii-basic-principles-of-law-weaving" tabindex="-1">II. Basic Principles of Law-Weaving <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-basic-principles-of-law-weaving" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Basic Principles of Law-Weaving&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Matter&#39;s essence, within Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s four-layer structure (material plane / energy layer / consciousness domain / law network), is <strong>laws&#39; solidified state in the material plane.</strong> In other words:</p><blockquote><p>One kind of matter = one set of law parameters × one energy density × one spatial coordinate</p></blockquote><p>Law-weaving is artificially setting these three variables, solidifying an entirely new kind of matter in the material plane. This process is analogous to &quot;printing&quot; — laws are ink, energy is paper, space is the printer.</p><p>Origin-grade cultivators may only use naturally existing matter; multiverse-grade cultivators may modify existing matter&#39;s structure; Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm cultivators may, from zero, weave entirely new matter that does not exist in nature.</p><h2 id="iii-three-layer-applications-of-law-weaving" tabindex="-1">III. Three-Layer Applications of Law-Weaving <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-three-layer-applications-of-law-weaving" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Three-Layer Applications of Law-Weaving&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Layer</th><th>Ability</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Modification Grade</td><td>Change existing matter&#39;s structure</td><td>Turn ordinary iron into law alloy</td></tr><tr><td>Synthesis Grade</td><td>Combine existing matter&#39;s traits</td><td>Synthesize building material possessing both steel and wood traits</td></tr><tr><td>Creation Grade</td><td>Weave from zero matter not existing in nature</td><td>Weave a new energy crystal existing only at the law layer</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The three-layer applications, from &quot;modify&quot; to &quot;combine&quot; to &quot;create,&quot; jump in ability step by step. Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm cultivators may do all three.</p><h2 id="iv-matter-creation-s-ethical-constraints" tabindex="-1">IV. Matter-Creation&#39;s Ethical Constraints <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-matter-creation-s-ethical-constraints" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Matter-Creation&#39;s Ethical Constraints&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-weaving ability is extremely strong, but not unconstrained:</p><ul><li><strong>Safety constraint</strong>: new matter must pass stability testing, preventing spontaneous decomposition or toxicity in the material plane;</li><li><strong>Compatibility constraint</strong>: new matter must be compatible with existing ecology, not disrupting the food chain after introduction;</li><li><strong>Distribution constraint</strong>: new matter must be distributed through the Myriad-Rank sharing mechanism; private hoarding is forbidden;</li><li><strong>Audit constraint</strong>: every kind of new matter&#39;s creation process is fully recorded in the Alaya Network, subject to audit.</li></ul><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the extraction mode digs finite stock less and less; the weaving mode creates infinite increment, fundamentally eliminating resource competition</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: new matter is woven increment; no need to grab others&#39; stock; the anti-predation axiom lands directly in the matter domain</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s matter is gift-style — whatever material Gu Chensha gives, you use; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s matter is co-created — Myriad Ranks jointly weave, jointly distribute</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: new-matter distribution is open to 99% of Myriad Ranks; different races may apply for new materials suited to them</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: law-weaving&#39;s technical principles, material recipes, and safety standards are all open network-wide through the Selfless Dao</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The law-weaving matter view fundamentally eliminates &quot;resource finiteness,&quot; the root anxiety troubling cosmos civilizations. When matter may be incrementally woven, predation loses its reason to exist — you need not grab, because you may weave. This is the anti-predation axiom&#39;s ultimate expression at the matter layer.</p><blockquote><p>Terminology note: the practices described in this entry ultimately land on Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-construction posts. Every cultivator participating in engineering has his contribution recorded in real time by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, automatically settling civilizational weight. All engineering design uses the law-first axiom as meta-rule, ensuring the 300-set Origin Cultivation System coordinates at hyper-multiverse scale without self-contradiction.</p></blockquote><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">Entry 15 · Energy Cycle and Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/13-空间法理调度体系详解.html">Entry 13 · Spatial-Law Dispatch System Details</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/80-位面理论与分类.html">Entry 80 · Plane Theory and Classification</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const m=t(r,[["render",o]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
